---
description: Conventions for intent, experience, spec and plan artifacts
globs: intent/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---
- Follow the templates in intent/_templates/.
- Editing an artifact never means changing application code.
- Do not change a Status line to `accepted` yourself. Only the human owner does.
- For user-visible work, do not write a spec until both intent.md and
  experience.md are accepted. Non-interactive work records Experience: none.
- Visible requirements and tasks trace to accepted UX-NNN criteria.
- Keep artifacts short and in the originator's terms. No filler sections.
